WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.179
The breeze that you're feeling isn't a storm
headed your way.

00:00:03.179 --> 00:00:07.540
No, it's a sign that the rumor mill is churning
once again, delivering to us an interesting

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.290
bit of speculation about the Marvel Cinematic
Universe.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:14.310
A recent report by We Got This Covered claims
that Marvel Studios is looking to bring the

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.200
superhero Moon Knight to the screen, and is
eyeing a former Spider-Man star to portray

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:18.860
him.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.840
Citing an unidentified source, the outlet
contends that Moon Knight will likely get

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:27.050
his own movie in the MCU, and that he could
be played by Andrew Garfield, who embodied

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:32.100
the web-slinging vigilante in 2012's The Amazing
Spider-Man and its ill-fated 2014 follow-up

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.900
The Amazing Spider-Man 2.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:34.720
"What?"

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:35.480
"Yeah.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.580
But I'm really excited!"

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:42.320
We Got This Covered alleges in another report
that Marvel wants a movie focused on Moon

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.960
Knight rather than a series that would end
up on Disney+.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:49.350
The company is also reportedly aiming to get
a Jewish actor to play the role of the nocturnal

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:52.549
hero, who has Jewish heritage, with a father
who's a Rabbi.

00:00:52.549 --> 00:00:57.080
Moon Knight's alter ego is a man named Marc
Spector who suffers from dissociative identity

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:57.920
disorder.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:02.020
While many people regard him as being simply
crazy, he also becomes the emissary of the

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.580
Egyptian God Khonshu, gaining supernatural
powers and stylizing himself as a caped crime-fighter.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:10.740
"This looks like Khonshu.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:14.840
It's bad enough having that Moon God sitting
in my head pulling my strings.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:17.420
Now he wants to have a line of toys, too?"

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:22.420
While the rumor hasn't been substantiated
outside of WGTC, Garfield would fit the bill

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:24.270
of what Marvel is reportedly looking for.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:28.880
The actor is known to have Polish-Jewish ancestry,
his family surname is said to have originally

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:33.270
been "Garfinkel," and his paternal grandparents
were part of Jewish immigrant families.

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:37.810
While Garfield has described himself as religiously
being more of an agnostic, he does identify

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.230
as Jewish and is proud of his Jewish heritage.

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:44.370
The idea of Garfield joining the MCU in his
post-Spider-Man days to become Moon Knight

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:48.280
is pretty mind-boggling, but, truth be told,
this rumor is very thin.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:52.900
The famously secretive Marvel Studios hasn't
said a peep about whether a movie or series

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.820
about Moon Knight is even a possibility.

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:59.340
Studio president Kevin Feige has been known
to keep a zipped lip on details about future

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:03.640
projects, but he did loosen up a great deal
during 2019's San Diego Comic-Con.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:08.280
At the event, Marvel held its hotly-anticipated
presentation at which the complete slate of

00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:12.319
films and TV series that will comprise Phase
4 of the MCU was announced.

00:02:12.319 --> 00:02:17.280
Feige even revealed that a Blade reboot starring
Mahershala Ali was in the works, and confirmed

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:23.209
that Black Panther 2, Captain Marvel 2, Guardians
of the Galaxy Vol. 3, a Fantastic Four movie,

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.680
and a film about the X-Men were all underway
at Marvel.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:29.740
There wasn't a word about Moon Knight - not
for the far-off, unannounced Phase 5, and

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.279
certainly not for Phase 4.

00:02:31.279 --> 00:02:35.120
Now, just because Feige and his fellow Marvel
executives haven't said anything about developing

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:38.940
a movie centered on Moon Knight doesn't mean
that it won't ever happen in the future.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:42.000
But there's no solid information to suggest
that this rumor is true.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.220
And though We Got This Covered notes that
the intel about Garfield being eyed to play

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:49.480
Marvel's Moon Knight comes from a source with
a, quote, "pretty strong track record" - the

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.769
same source that leaked the info about the
post-credits scene in the Avengers: Endgame

00:02:52.769 --> 00:02:56.840
re-release, plus the news about the real Mandarin
appearing in Shang-Chi and the Legend of the

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:01.040
Ten Rings - it's just not possible to say
with any certainty how true this report really

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:01.540
is.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:05.820
Another thing complicating the idea that Garfield
will portray Moon Knight in an upcoming Marvel

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:09.520
movie is the fact that he isn't the only person
said to be on Marvel's wishlist.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:13.700
He's apparently only one of several names
Marvel is reportedly considering for the role,

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.980
and may have major competition in another
actor well-versed in the comic book movie

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:17.660
world.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:21.140
We Got This Covered, citing the very same
source that's evidently a bottomless well

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:25.870
of Marvel-related information, has also claimed
that the studio is eyeing Joseph Gordon-Levitt,

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:29.020
the man behind police officer John Blake in
The Dark Knight Rises.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:33.260
Like Garfield, Gordon-Levitt is Jewish, meaning
there's a chance that Marvel does have him

00:03:33.269 --> 00:03:36.019
on its wishlist, if the outlet's other report
is to be believed.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.280
As we've said, this is all speculation for
now.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:42.500
Only time will tell if Marvel hands Moon Knight
the greatest gift of all - a solo movie - and

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.240
whether or not Garfield will be the lucky
guy to take the lead.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.360
"You want me to come down there so you can
kill me?"

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.260
"Yes."

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.440
"I'll be right there."

